FFmpeg

This product bundles unmodified FFmpeg binaries (ffmpeg.exe, ffprobe.exe and
the accompanying libav* / libsw* DLLs) and runs them as separate programs.

FFmpeg is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3 or
later (LGPL v3+). The full licence text is in bin/FFMPEG-LICENSE.txt.

The build shipped here is the LGPL configuration from
https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds, produced from the FFmpeg sources at
https://git.ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg.git . The binaries are unmodified; the exact
build and its sources can be obtained from those two addresses, and the
bundled DLLs may be replaced with your own LGPL-compatible build by putting
them in the bin folder next to the executables.
